<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Support — Level Up Musicianship</title>
<meta name="description" content="Help keep Level Up Musicianship's ear-training games free for classrooms everywhere.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #1B2A4A;
    --ink-soft: #33456B;
    --paper: #F7F3E8;
    --paper-line: #E4DCC7;
    --amber: #C8842A;
    --amber-deep: #9C6519;
    --text: #2A2A28;
    --text-soft: #5B5A52;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html { scroll-padding-top: 90px; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'Work Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  h1, h2 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  a { color: var(--amber-deep); }
  a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

  /* Nav, matching the site's existing structure */
  nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 28px 24px 16px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  nav .brand {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  nav ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    gap: 26px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  nav a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  nav a.current {
    color: var(--amber-deep);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }

  /* Staff-line motif: a nod to sheet music, used once as a divider, not decoration everywhere */
  .staff {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .staff-lines {
    height: 42px;
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0,
      transparent 9px,
      var(--paper-line) 9px,
      var(--paper-line) 10px
    );
    margin: 8px 0 44px;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 8px 24px 80px;
  }

  .eyebrow-free {
    /* intentionally no tracked-out label above the heading */
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    max-width: 15ch;
  }

  .lede {
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .support-list {
    margin: 40px 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .support-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
  }

  .support-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
  }

  .support-list .mark {
    color: var(--amber-deep);
    font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .support-list p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .support-list strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .kofi-panel {
    margin-top: 56px;
  }

  .kofi-panel h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .kofi-panel .sub {
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .kofi-embed {
    border: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .kofi-embed iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    border: none;
  }

  .thanks {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .thanks strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  footer {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 24px 24px 40px;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    nav { flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; }
    nav ul { gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .support-list li { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a class="brand" href="/">Level Up Musicianship</a>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="/games">Games</a></li>
    <li><a href="/activities">Activities</a></li>
    <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
    <li><a class="current" href="/support">Support</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<div class="staff">
  <div class="staff-lines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>

<main>
  <h1>Help keep the games free.</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Level Up Musicianship started as a way to give students a fun way to explore
    ear training without having to download or login. Every game on this site is free to
    play — donations just help cover hosting and the time that goes
    into building the next one.
  </p>

  <ul class="support-list">
    <li>
      <span class="mark">&#9834;</span>
      <p><strong>Hosting &amp; upkeep.</strong> Keeps the site fast, ad-free, and online for classrooms.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="mark">&#9834;</span>
      <p><strong>New games.</strong> Every ear training game takes design, testing, and classroom trial time.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="mark">&#9834;</span>
      <p><strong>Kept free.</strong> No subscriptions, no logins, no ads — donations are what make that possible long-term.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="kofi-panel">
    <h2>Buy me a coffee</h2>
    <p class="sub">One-off or monthly — whatever suits. Thank you for your support.</p>
    <div class="kofi-embed">
      <iframe
        id="kofiframe"
        src="https://ko-fi.com/levelupmusicianship/?hidefeed=true&widget=true&embed=true"
        height="712"
        title="Support Level Up Musicianship on Ko-fi">
      </iframe>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="thanks">
    <strong>Thank you</strong> for teaching with these games and sharing them with colleagues.
    That's the whole reason this exists.
  </p>
</main>

<footer>
  © 2026 Tsun-En Cheng — Built for music classrooms everywhere
</footer>

</body>
</html>
